#: ../../user/changelog.md:47
msgid ""
"Project Wizard with 12 templates (Basic, Vite+React, Next.js, Electron, "
"Hono, Cloudflare Workers, AWS Lambda, Google Cloud Run, React Native, npm"
" Library, CLI Tool, Monorepo)"
msgstr ""
"12 テンプレート対応のプロジェクトウィザード（Basic、Vite+React、Next.js、Electron、"
"Hono、Cloudflare Workers、AWS Lambda、Google Cloud Run、React Native、npm"
" Library、CLI Tool、Monorepo）"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:48
msgid "Code Generation (Switch Arms, Module Type)"
msgstr "コード生成（Switch Arms、Module Type）"

